  "posts": [
    {
      "voiceId": "trevor-noah",
      "voiceName": "Trevor Noah",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Is Your Job Safe?\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/Trevornoah/status/2060181079055872455",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-29T02:07:00+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "trevor-noah",
      "voiceName": "Trevor Noah",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "I asked Hasan how he feels about being\ncalled \u201cthe Joe Rogan of the left,\" and somehow we\nended up discussing podcast culture, political\nmessaging, CNN energy, elk hunting, and whether\n\u201cgoon\u201d is an acceptable adult insult. \ud83d\ude02\n\nReally fascinating conversation. \n\nFull episode is up now on my YouTube channel. \n\n#HasanPiker #JoeRogan #WhatNowPodcast\n#TrevorNoah\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/Trevornoah/status/2060035874864197650",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-28T16:30:00+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "trevor-noah",
      "voiceName": "Trevor Noah",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Is Gen Z Killing the Art of Waiting?\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/Trevornoah/status/2059824982721790122",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-28T02:32:00+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "trevor-noah",
      "voiceName": "Trevor Noah",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Wil started telling me about his parents escaping Haiti and somehow the story transformed from Haitian Romeo &amp; Juliet into Haitian Terminator \ud83d\ude33\n\nWatch the full conversation now on my YouTube channel.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/Trevornoah/status/2059674239314342110",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-27T16:33:00+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "trevor-noah",
      "voiceName": "Trevor Noah",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Not every angry comment is personal. Sometimes people are just joining the noise because everyone else is.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/Trevornoah/status/2059459574793400560",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-27T02:20:00+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "trevor-noah",
      "voiceName": "Trevor Noah",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Wil casually told me he invented \u201csolar powered paint\u201d in 1994 and for a solid minute I genuinely couldn\u2019t tell if I was speaking to a genius or a man confidently making things up \ud83d\ude02\n\nThe full episode is out now on my YouTube channel.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/Trevornoah/status/2059311096545378530",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-26T16:30:00+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "trevor-noah",
      "voiceName": "Trevor Noah",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Wil Sylvince\u2019s mom found out he was doing stand-up\u2026 by seeing him on TV.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/Trevornoah/status/2059102723430080585",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-26T02:42:00+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "trevor-noah",
      "voiceName": "Trevor Noah",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "I said: \"Being naughty is easier than being good\u2026\"\n\nThen Wil immediately brought up kids sticking forks into electrical outlets. \ud83d\ude02\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/Trevornoah/status/2058947198705184997",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-25T16:24:00+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "trevor-noah",
      "voiceName": "Trevor Noah",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "One of the hardest parts of any relationship is realizing there\u2019s always another version of the story.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/Trevornoah/status/2058729946496012753",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-25T02:00:43+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "trevor-noah",
      "voiceName": "Trevor Noah",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Wil said \u201cinterpretate\u201d and honestly\u2026 I immediately knew exactly what he meant. \ud83d\ude02\n\nWatch the full episode now on YouTube.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/Trevornoah/status/2058582546292645928",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-24T16:15:00+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "trevor-noah",
      "voiceName": "Trevor Noah",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "The doctor looked at me and said:\n\n\u201cYou know this could cost a lot of money.\u201d\n\nSir\u2026 it\u2019s my mother.\n\nWatch the full conversation now on YouTube. \n\n#whatnow\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/Trevornoah/status/2058219151362273452",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-23T16:11:00+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "trevor-noah",
      "voiceName": "Trevor Noah",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "History doesn\u2019t just disappear because time passes. \nSome conversations stay complicated long after the headlines move on.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/Trevornoah/status/2058010526634983503",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-23T02:22:00+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
